---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Hero from '../components/Hero.astro';
---
<Base title="Aurora Coffee — Small-batch roasting">
  <div class="tim-canvas" data-tim-canvas>
    <div class="tim-object" style="grid-area: 1 / 2 / 5 / 18;">
      <Hero
        heading="Aurora Coffee"
        tagline="Small-batch roasting in a big-flavor town."
      />
    </div>
    <div class="tim-object tim-text tim-style-body" style="grid-area: 5 / 2 / 9 / 14;">We roast twice a week in the old print shop on Miller Street. Every bag ships within two days of roasting, because coffee is produce, not pantry.</div>
    <div class="tim-object tim-text tim-style-heading" style="grid-area: 10 / 2 / 12 / 12;">This season</div>
    <div class="tim-object tim-text tim-style-body" style="grid-area: 12 / 2 / 17 / 12;">The spring lineup leans bright: a washed Ethiopia with notes of apricot and bergamot, and a Colombian honey process that tastes like caramel found an orchard.</div>
    <div class="tim-object tim-text tim-style-heading" style="grid-area: 10 / 14 / 12 / 24;">Visit us</div>
    <div class="tim-object tim-text tim-style-body" style="grid-area: 12 / 14 / 17 / 24;">The roastery is open Saturdays from nine to noon. Bring a mug and we will fill it while you watch the drum spin.</div>
  </div>
</Base>
